Cell["\<\
On the 6 \[Times] 6 grid the steps right and up commute away from the rim: \
the loop is the identity on the 16 vertices of the lower left 4 \[Times] 4 \
block. Near the top row and the right column the clamped steps are not \
injective, and the inverses carry a vertex back to every vertex with the same \
image.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"423e6032-b374-461f-a814-56ff988227cd"],

